<refsynopsisdiv id="dpm_agentd.synopsis">
    <title>Synopsis</title>
    <cmdsynopsis><command>dpm_agentd</command>
    </cmdsynopsis>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsect1 id="dpm_agentd.options">
    <title>Arguments</title>
    <para>Accepted arguments:</para>
    <variablelist>
        <varlistentry>
            <term><option>--properties</option></term>
            <listitem>
            <para>The dpm.properties configuration file to use.</para>
            </listitem>
        </varlistentry>
        <varlistentry>
            <term><option>--logdir</option></term>
            <listitem>
            <para>The directory to which dpm_agentd should send its log file. </para>
            </listitem>
        </varlistentry>
        <varlistentry>
            <term><option>--host</option></term>
            <listitem>
            <para>Specify comma separated host:port pairs to connect to dpm_server. </para>
            </listitem>
        </varlistentry>
        <varlistentry>
            <term><option>--debug</option></term>
            <listitem>
            <para>Debug mode sends log output to the console and runs dpm_agentd as a foreground
	      process. </para>
            </listitem>
        </varlistentry>
        <varlistentry>
            <term><option>--users</option></term>
            <listitem>
            <para>List of user IDs to which dpm_agentd is permitted to switch.  Specify "root" to
	      disallow user ID switching.  This parameter is usually set in the dpm agent init script.
	      The requested user ID is set in dpm.properties under the [agent] section as agentuid=
	    </para>
            </listitem>
        </varlistentry>
        <varlistentry>
            <term><option>--workingdir</option></term>
            <listitem>
            <para>Fully qualified working directory for dpm_agentd and child processes
            </para>
            </listitem>
        </varlistentry>
        <varlistentry>
            <term><option>--help</option></term>
            <listitem>
            <para>usage </para>
            </listitem>
        </varlistentry>

    </variablelist>

</refsect1>

<refsect1 id="dpm_agentd.description">
    <title>Description</title>
    <para>dpm_agentd is the DPM system's process watcher.
      dpm_agentd operates solely on instructions from dpm_server.
      dpm_agentd should be started from the dpm agent init script at system startup time and
      allowed to run continuously in the background.</para>
</refsect1>


